Selenium 4 support Relative locators
-----------------------------------------
For Identifications selenium support two methods
------------------------------------------------
1.findElement()
----------------------
- findElement() identify Single webElement
- it returns WebElement interface object
- If element not found then it throws exception NoSuchElementException

2.findElements()
------------------------
- findElements() identify multiple webElements
- it returns List<WebElement> interface object
- If element not found then will not throw any exception you will get empty list


